&= \frac{\sqrt{3}\cdot 5\text{side } CDEF}{12\sqrt{4}} \\
&= \frac{5\text{side } CDEF}{24}
\end{align*}
Side $PH$ equals $PG + PG = \frac{5\text{side } CDEF}{12}$.

Finally, side $PA = PD + DB$:
