& = \sin^{-1} \left(\frac{2}{\sqrt{1 - (-1)^2} + \sqrt{4 - 1}} \right) \text{ \quad RTF } \\
& = \sin^{-1} \left(\frac{2}{\sqrt{1 + 1}}\right) \text{ \quad reverse identity } \\
& = \sin^{-1} \left(1\right) \text{ \quad \quad \quad simplify } \\
