\end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 0 & 0 & 0 \\ x_1 & x_2 & x_3 \end{pmatrix} \begin{pmatrix} 0 \\ y_1 \\ 0
\end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 0 \\ 0 \\ 0 \end{pmatrix} \text{ and }
